<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ABSA APPOINTS JONKER NON-EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR.</title>
<headline>ABSA APPOINTS JONKER NON-EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amalgamated Banks of South Africa Ltd (Absa) said on Monday that Lourens Jonker had been appointed as a non-executive director of the company's board.</p>
<p>Jonker is currently chairman of KWV Investments Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
